{"id":3379,"date":"2026-06-24T07:44:34","date_gmt":"2026-06-24T07:44:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3379"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:50:56","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:50:56","slug":"nature-birds-mosaic-designer-wall-tile","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/nature-birds-mosaic-designer-wall-tile\/","title":{"rendered":"Nature Birds Mosaic Designer Wall Tile"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"1182\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"718\">Nature Birds Mosaic Designer Wall Tile Panel<\/strong>, a premium decorative wall tile solution crafted for architectural spaces that seek artistic expression, nature-inspired design, and sophisticated interior styling. Inspired by handcrafted mosaic artistry and contemporary decorative wall concepts, this exclusive tile panel beautifully showcases an elegant composition of intricately detailed birds resting on natural branches surrounded by delicate floral patterns that create a visually striking statement wall.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1613\">Designed using precision mosaic tile craftsmanship, this decorative panel blends soft ivory backgrounds with carefully balanced earthy brown, muted blue, warm beige, and natural neutral shades that create an elegant harmony between artistic detailing and architectural sophistication. The natural composition adds depth, texture, and visual richness, transforming ordinary wall surfaces into premium decorative art installations.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"2198\">Manufactured using premium quality wall tile materials and advanced surface finishing technology, this designer wall panel offers exceptional durability, smooth surface finishing, long-lasting visual performance, and low maintenance for everyday applications. The refined handcrafted mosaic appearance makes it an ideal design element for luxury resident